/** @dir Lib/MakeASound/Realtime
    Helpers for code on the audio thread (namespace MakeASound); part of
    MakeASoundCore.

    - SPSCQueue is a bounded wait-free queue between exactly one producer and
      one consumer thread, for passing data to and from the audio callback.
    - Smoother ramps a parameter towards its target one sample at a time.
    - ScopedNoDenormals flushes denormal floats to zero on the current thread
      while it lives.
    - SpinLock guards small state the audio thread shares with a host thread.
*/
